    given-names: Vivika
date-released: "2026-08-12"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vivimartini/themis-mechanism-multi-agent-simulation"
keywords:
  - carbon pricing
  - mechanism design
  - empirical game-theoretic analysis
  - multi-agent simulation
  - strategic reporting
abstract: >-
  Research code accompanying an MPhil dissertation in Machine Learning and
  Machine Intelligence at the University of Cambridge. The software reproduces
  the Themis operating-point calculation and evaluates strategic reporting in a
  calibrated nine-actor empirical game.
